	["Walk the loop and pick every {item:3821} (170, green), {object:2043} (185, green), {item:4625} (205, green, rare), {item:8831} (210, green), {item:8838} (230, yellow), {item:8839} (235, yellow), {item:8845} (245, orange), {item:8846} (250, orange), {item:13464} (260, orange) on the way until {skill:182} 285. {item:8845} grows in caves and dark hollows: look inside as well. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. {item:8846} grows near demon and satyr camps: pull carefully. The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 50 herbs for these 25 points: about 20 {item:8839}, 20 {item:8838}, 10 {item:8831}, 10 {object:2043}, 5 {item:3821}, 5 {item:13464}, 5 {item:4625}, 5 {item:8845} and 5 {item:249274}. For {skill:171}: about 45 {item:8838} and 40 {item:3821} in all."] = "",

	-- Step 20: Mountain Silversage & Plaguebloom (285-300)
