	["Walk the loop and pick every {item:8831} (210, green), {item:8836} (220, green), {item:8838} (230, green), {item:8846} (250, yellow, rare), {item:13464} (260, yellow), {item:13463} (270, orange), {item:13465} (280, orange), {item:13466} (285, orange) on the way until {skill:182} 300. {item:8831} sometimes gives a {item:8153} as well. {item:8846} grows near demon and satyr camps: pull carefully. Quests in these zones need {skill:182}: Salve via Gathering (level 55, {npc:9528}, {zone:1448}; Alliance), Salve via Gathering (level 55, {npc:9529}, {zone:1448}; Horde). The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 20 herbs for these 15 points: about 5 {item:13463}, 5 {item:8831}, 5 {item:13465}, 5 {item:13464} and 5 {item:8838}. For {skill:171}: about 45 {item:8838} in all."] = "",

	-- No longer in the guide (its English changed or it went away): reuse or delete.
	-- ["Any {skill:182} trainer of your faction teaches Apprentice {skill:182} (character level 5); the arrow picks the nearest."] = "你陣營的任何{skill:182}訓練師都能教初級{skill:182}（角色等級5）；箭頭會指向最近的一位。",
	-- ["Journeyman {skill:182} raises the cap to 150; it needs skill 50 and character level 10. The arrow picks the nearest {skill:182} trainer of your faction."] = "中級{skill:182}將上限提高至150；需要技能50且角色等級10。箭頭會指向你陣營最近的{skill:182}訓練師。",
